# MAROOM

Tinder-style furniture recommendation app for college students and young adults furnishing their first space.

---

## Features (Current Beta)

- **Swipe to discover** — left/right swipe to browse furniture; right swipes auto-save to your Liked list
- **Card flip** — double-tap any card to reveal details
- **Explore** — image grid with filter modal UI
- **Saved** — view your liked items by category
- **Auth** — email signup/login with session tokens

---

## Tech Stack

**Frontend** — `MAROOM/frontend/`

| | |
|---|---|
| Framework | Expo 54, React Native 0.81.5 |
| Language | TypeScript |
| Routing | Expo Router (file-based) |
| Animation | react-native-reanimated 4.1.1 |
| Gestures | react-native-gesture-handler |
| HTTP | axios |
| Auth storage | expo-secure-store |
| Architecture | Feature-Sliced Design (FSD) |

**Backend** — `MAROOM/backend/`

| | |
|---|---|
| Framework | Spring Boot 4.0.1 |
| Language | Java 17 |
| Database | Supabase PostgreSQL (cloud) |
| Auth | BCrypt + session tokens |

---

## Getting Started

### Prerequisites

- Node.js + npm
- Expo Go app on your phone or an iOS/Android simulator
- Java 17
- Access to the Supabase database (ask a backend for credentials)

### Frontend

```bash
cd MAROOM/frontend
npm install
```

Create a `.env.local` file with your machine's local IP:

```
EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://YOUR_LOCAL_IP:8080
```

```bash
npm start        # scan QR with Expo Go
npm run ios      # iOS simulator
npm run android  # Android emulator
```

### Backend

```bash
cd MAROOM/backend
./mvnw spring-boot:run
```

Runs on port **8080**. Requires the Supabase connection configured in `src/main/resources/application.properties`.

---

## Project Structure

```
MAROOM/
├── frontend/
│   └── src/
│       ├── app/       # Expo Router routes
│       ├── pages/     # Full screens
│       ├── widgets/   # Multi-feature UI blocks
│       ├── features/  # Isolated feature logic
│       ├── entities/  # Domain types & API functions
│       └── shared/    # API client, config, reusable UI
└── backend/
    └── src/main/java/com/maroom/maroom/
        ├── controller/
        ├── entity/
        ├── repository/
        └── service/
```

---

## API Endpoints

| Method | Path | Description |
|--------|------|-------------|
| POST | `/auth/signup` | Register new user |
| POST | `/auth/login` | Login, returns session token |
| GET | `/api/furniture-items` | All furniture items |
| POST | `/swipe` | Record swipe; RIGHT auto-saves to Liked list |
| GET | `/saved/{userId}` | Fetch user's saved items |
| POST/GET | `/preferences` | Save/fetch onboarding quiz results |

